    "expected": {"deleted": ["app-2026-10-29.log", "app-2026-10-30.log", "sql-2026-10-29.log", "sql-2026-10-30.log", "sql-2026-10-31.log", "sql-2026-11-01.log"]},
    "note": "Defaults. Rule 2: app keeps ages 0..4 (11-04 .. 10-31), sql keeps ages 0..2 (11-04 .. 11-02). Size far below the cap."
